---
InheritParentConfig: true
# GoogleTest idioms that the strict library configuration would reject:
#   cognitive-complexity: every EXPECT_*/ASSERT_* macro expands into branches.
#   non-private-member-variables: fixtures expose their state to TEST_F bodies by design.
Checks: >
  -readability-function-cognitive-complexity,
  -misc-non-private-member-variables-in-classes,
  -cppcoreguidelines-non-private-member-variables-in-classes
...
